## [0.4.3] - 2026-03-23
- Pro activation: keep device-bound activation local per device, follow backend redirects during activation, and preserve the startup-only monthly validation flow with daily retry fallback.
- Pro runtime gating: stop mutating synced settings for Pro/free transitions by moving feature gating to runtime-only effective state.
