- Mobile/license UX: restore the generic activation failure notice, keep the License row to a single Pro status line, and avoid persisting transient activation errors.
- Docs/tests/context: update the Context Pack and add regression coverage for activation persistence, validation cadence, redirect handling, and maintenance rebuild behavior.

## [0.4.2] - 2026-03-23
- Pro activation: keep device-bound activation state local per device, add offline grace handling, and switch validation to startup-only monthly checks.
- Pro settings UI: restore the masked key preview locally, refine focus/blur behavior, tighten status text, and make the license input/button stack when space is tight.
- License messaging: remove device counts from notices and simplify the device-limit message to contact support.
- Release tooling: allow manual release publishing again.
- Docs/tests/context: update README/context-pack wording and add regression coverage for the new activation persistence and validation flow.

## [0.4.1] - 2026-03-22
- Pro licensing: switch activation to backend claim-key/token verification, remove the legacy local license generator, and preserve only a masked key preview in settings.
- Pro settings UI: refine the license row with clearer status text, inline last-check display, compact desktop layout, and full-width mobile input behavior.
- AI bridge and branding: refresh bridge assets/logo usage and update packaged imagery.
- Release tooling: harden release-sync/push-both handling and keep production packaging aligned with the release repo flow.
- Docs/tests: update README/context wording and add regression coverage for the new Pro activation flow.

## [0.4.0] - 2026-03-19
