- Metadata: bump minimum Obsidian version to 1.12.4.

## [0.3.53] - 2026-03-17
- Summaries: prefer YAML frontmatter `description` for tracked-change entries.
- Timeline navigation: ignore recurring records when normal matches exist; when only recurring is visible, anchor/snap to the oldest recurring.

## [0.3.52] - 2026-03-17
