- Page preview: cancel the delayed hover preview if the cursor/hover target changes before the delay elapses.

## [0.3.50] - 2026-03-16
- Timeline navigation: reset scroll-nav target/anchor on index refreshes and timeline view changes (filters/settings/view toggles).
